# 本地业务 API（REST Client / httpYac）
# 先启动：pnpm --filter agentic-rag-business-service dev
# 默认端口见 apps/agentic-rag-business-service/.env.dev（9020；9000/9001 为 Compose RustFS）

@host = http://127.0.0.1
@port = 9020
@baseUrl = {{host}}:{{port}}

### Root greeting
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Typed greeting (oRPC contract route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/greeting

### Health whoami
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/whoami

### OpenAPI JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json

### List documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?page=1&pageSize=20

### Create document
# @name createDocument
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "http client smoke test",
  "content": "## smoke\n\nfrom __tests__/business-api.http"
}

### Get document (uses id from create)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{createDocument.response.body.id}}

### Update document
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{createDocument.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "http client smoke test (updated)"
}

### Soft delete document
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{createDocument.response.body.id}}

### Get after delete (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{createDocument.response.body.id}}

### Upload and parse Markdown (no MinerU token required)
# @name uploadMarkdown
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload/parse
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AgentHubBoundary

------AgentHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

http client upload smoke test
------AgentHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="smoke.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

## upload smoke

from __tests__/business-api.http
------AgentHubBoundary--

### Get uploaded document
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{uploadMarkdown.response.body.id}}

### Upload and parse PDF (in-process pdf-parse)
# 把 ./sample.pdf 换成本地文件路径（相对本 .http 文件）
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload/parse
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AgentHubBoundary

------AgentHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
------AgentHubBoundary--

### Upload unsupported type (expect 415 DOCUMENT_FILE_TYPE_UNSUPPORTED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload/parse
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AgentHubBoundary

------AgentHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="tool.exe"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

MZ
------AgentHubBoundary--

### Validation error (expect 400 — missing content)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "bad request"
}
